LAASHE AKBAR TAK MERE BABA MUJHE PAHUNCHAIYE<br>
 LADKHADATE HAIN KHADAM MERE MADAD FARMAIYE<br>
<br>
LE GAYA MERI BASARAT SAATH APNE MERA LAAL,<br>
 RAASAT KAISE KARON TAI AAP HI FARMAIYE<br>
<br>
KAISE KHAINCHOON NAUJAWAN BETE KE SEENE SE SINA,<br>
HAQ ATA QHUWWAT KARE MUJHKO DUA FARMAIYE<br>
<br>
KHAAK-O-KHOON MEIN BHAR GAYI TASWEER-E-KHATM UL MURSALEEN,<br>
 AAP BHI AAKAR ZARA DEEDAR TO FARMAIYE<br>
<br>
UNKO BHI ANDAAZA KUCH HOJAYE MERE SABAR KAR,<br>
 HAZRAT-E-AYYUB KO BHI SAATH APNE LAIYE<br>
<br>
MAA KHADI HAIN MUNTAZAR LE JAON KISTARHA,<br>
 AAP HI KHAIME KE DAR TAK SAATH MERE AAIYE<br>
<br>
KITNI HASRAT SE BAYAN KARTE THE YE SARWAR SAEED,<br>
MERE BABA AAIYE AB AAYIE AAJAIYE